00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:11,680
And so I think this is an example of a thing where, uh, controversy can sell well, right?

448
00:40:12,160 --> 00:40:17,600
It can raise your profile, maybe even raise your sales or whatever, but there's obviously some sort of cost to that, right?

