00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:40,080
I don't, I mean, so the only people I ever spoke to were the engineering people who always were very supportive of what I was doing.

451
00:40:40,880 --> 00:40:46,240
I think those decisions were made at sort of more product marketing levels.

452
00:40:48,160 --> 00:40:50,560
I don't know if Phil Schiller knows who I am.

453
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:52,160
I suspect he's heard my name.

454
00:40:52,640 --> 00:40:54,960
What do you think his score is in the About screen?

